      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SON OF MANADO (1) tackled far tougher grade latest when finishing 8th over 400m at this track. Was a this track winner in lesser company the start prior. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Ready to return to form. HELL BENT (4) boasts a strong record this course with five wins and five minors from 13 tries. Was out of placings last time (22.79) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing fourth and beaten 1.5 lengths. Can hit the frame with the right run. CANYA SUCCEED (6) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (27.82) at this track behind Canya Caviar in a Grade 5/6. Has the pace to be prominent. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Will give a great sight again. MALCOLM BYTE (2) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
